    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20051202.0007\n\nLAKE LOUISE, Canada, Dec 2 , 2005\n\nItaly's Recchia crashes during Lake Louise downhill\n\n\n\n\nItaly's Lucia Recchia crashed at high speed in Friday's women's World Cup downhill and was airlifted to hospital.\n\nStarting from the 18th spot, the 26-year-old Recchia apparently lost a ski and hit a gate shortly after starting her run, then before crashed through the safety netting on the side of the course.\n\nShe was put on a stretcher and airlifted off the mountain by helicopter to a waiting ambulance.\n\nRecchia was conscious as ski patrol and medical staff assisted her on the mountain.",
